# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the emulation-thread tests (#967).  Empty on purpose: add an entry only for a race
# inside a third-party library (SDL, ...), with the report and the reason, never for the app's own code.

# libdbus (system library, not instrumented) takes two of its own mutexes in opposite orders in SDL_Init and SDL_Quit,
# both on the main thread: a lock-order-inversion inside libdbus, reported on Linux CI for every threaded app run (#967).
deadlock:libdbus-1.so
